{"title":"Sim Works Doppo Ronin Frameset in Golden Moss","link":"https://theradavist.com/sim-works-doppo-ronin-frameset-in-golden-moss","date":1791477198000,"content":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/60ff51555083f3c57bf6ae1ccbb03804dfee946c80b5ff18e5b1e548da4f377d.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/478af8dac0b18dbf833725d512314f8c4fda2cb5509df5d96dbcaa901a6d8b4f.jpg 640w, /media/60ff51555083f3c57bf6ae1ccbb03804dfee946c80b5ff18e5b1e548da4f377d.jpg 1800w, /media/8eff5cb07f9dd795de59ab08dfef5882f2f60f8dea67330dadb6d862ed982086.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://theradavist.com/tag/sim-works\" target=\"_blank\">Sim Works</a>‘ flat or drop bar all-rounder, the Doppo Ronin, now comes in Golden Moss, a rich, deep green color that sparkles in the sun.</em><span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/2f037753e3e8936a52d84801cc39401bca47603ec16b440b48d040b0933aa9be.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/5a24c5bd179740f9b488a7edf5e6726c8d447625b4fc584e523e7197a8c61084.jpg 800w, /media/c49ccd8190ab8630ab4cc06987c981584fab36dcfe33e3302e9747c10de9a23b.jpg 1600w, /media/2f037753e3e8936a52d84801cc39401bca47603ec16b440b48d040b0933aa9be.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/84eb87e925ea581dbabf34ac6fb5ebce60942994c25a8c5f376563088070934b.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/61bbd2ea9f854043099e3861ea15f228ef05c20935802e6e08f777db7bf1a737.jpg 800w, /media/dc8ec182c8fe7e387e8f81f25b049c4a4e29d2ed626fed695c99097f259a1278.jpg 1600w, /media/84eb87e925ea581dbabf34ac6fb5ebce60942994c25a8c5f376563088070934b.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>The name Ronin (浪人) signifies “wandering the world without being bound by anything.” This ethos is reflected in its design, emphasizing versatility within the many standards and conventions of an ever evolving bicycle landscape. It accommodates a wide range of preferred configurations and tire sizes, offering greater flexibility. The bike that you select for 90% of the riding you do—this is the essence of Ronin as a tool. Doppo Ronin’s non-boost chassis is convertible between 700c and 650b, accommodating tires up to 43mm with 700c wheels and up to 55mm (2.1 inches) with 650b (27.5”) wheels.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/a635419f071736bb6ac0bfd5bca72a7038f1a7bf0cf3a1a9abaacbc46de001a5.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/a76792d94138b68ceaf18297390bac921a07431117aa0451336d4700bbee1f60.jpg 640w, /media/a635419f071736bb6ac0bfd5bca72a7038f1a7bf0cf3a1a9abaacbc46de001a5.jpg 1800w, /media/4ab1a34929ef84584ad41a6f7abc79992c7b3cacf23eeb77b9507942ee1365fd.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/c2610c85de137ab085bbb6a1852c7d98df7a3f0202e365d0b77cdc6d46cf382c.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/61a3ff2714a84fa219d7f09a94c7ac678e2e49eec60f20c6c164399264d0cdf9.jpg 800w, /media/a1a950f10bd5cb430664518002184cc4441fdc8ab8f5197a2a17bc4b21840f10.jpg 1600w, /media/c2610c85de137ab085bbb6a1852c7d98df7a3f0202e365d0b77cdc6d46cf382c.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/cd73082041990c5c67455cda7e2322b6ebae03a3b9aab79bff1c5e93bdc915fe.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/b68d91bab43a1472141fa6a7c3c27433b62560691efd1770a8da78c338717c90.jpg 800w, /media/be94a7894eb0ca2617d0d9784f2d0ec407f3a5ccb075c05b2051cdd03c5b62cb.jpg 1600w, /media/cd73082041990c5c67455cda7e2322b6ebae03a3b9aab79bff1c5e93bdc915fe.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Handmade by Shin Hattori Works, a renowned bike frame builder from Aichi, Japan, the Doppo Ronin retails for $2,400 in sizes small through XXL and is in stock, shipping from <a href=\"https://www.sim.works/products/simworks-doppo-ronin-frame-set-golden-moss\" target=\"_blank\">Sim Works</a> today.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/sim-works-doppo-ronin-frameset-in-golden-moss\">Sim Works Doppo Ronin Frameset in Golden Moss</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"John Watson","comments":"https://theradavist.com/sim-works-doppo-ronin-frameset-in-golden-moss#respond","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"2a3e020c665632edefbdb100ea543c7524de10086b266688b4a9397e3323b39c","category":"Cycling"}